'''HOTU''' is a [[:category:Russia|Russian]] esports organization based out of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakha_Republic Republic of Sakha] in the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russian_Far_East Russian Far East].

