|content1=
* February 1st - '''HOTU''' sign a roster consisting of [[kuunso]], [[gokushima]], [[casE]], [[mizu (Russian player)|mizu]] and [[Ruler]]. <ref name="HOTU CS:GO">{{inside source|source=wehawt7}}</ref>
* December 10th - '''HOTU''' part ways with [[Ruler]] and sign [[nitzie]]. <ref name="-Ruler +nitzie">{{inside source|source=wehawt7}}</ref>

|content2=
* November 3rd - '''HOTU''' sign [[anttzz]]. <ref name="+anttzz">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_4042|title= Дмитрий «anttzz» Кириллин успешно прошёл тест и официально присоединяется в основной состав в роли рифлера|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Dmitry "anttzz" Kirillin successfully passed the test and officially joins the main roster as a riffler|date=2023-11-03|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 17th - '''HOTU''' bench [[nitzie]]. <ref name="nitzie bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_4294|title=Сегодня мы объявляем, что Никита «nitzie» Прохоров покидает активный состав HOTU и переходит на скамейку запасных|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today we announce that Nikita "nitzie" Prokhorov is leaving the active HOTU roster and moving to the bench|date=2024-01-17|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* January 21st - '''HOTU''' add [[znxxX]] on a trial basis. <ref name="+znxxX (trial)">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_4329|title=Алексей znxxX присоединяется к нашему составу по CS2 на тестовый период|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Alexey znxxX joins our CS2 roster for a test period|date=2024-01-21|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* March 26th - '''HOTU''' bench [[casE]] and part ways with [[znxxX]]. <ref name="-znxxX, casE bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_4676|title=Как думаете, кого мы подпишем?|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Who do you think we'll sign?|date=2024-03-26|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* April 12th - '''HOTU''' terminate [[nitzie]] and [[casE]] contracts. <ref name="-nitzie -casE">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_4808|title=Руководство приняло решение досрочно расторгнуть контракт с игроками nitzie и casE|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=The management decided to terminate the contract with players nitzie and casE early|date=2024-04-12|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* April 15th - '''HOTU''' sign [[lampada]] and [[fineshine]]. <ref name="+lampada +fineshine">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_4838|title=Официально подписаны контракты с игроками fineshine52 и lampada|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Contracts have been officially signed with players fineshine52 and lampada|date=2024-04-15|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* July 11th - '''HOTU''' bench [[swiftsteel]]. <ref name="swiftsteel bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_5197|title=Сегодня активный ростер команды HOTU покидает наш друг, брат и капитан — Ньургун «swiftsteel» Аввакумов!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today our friend, brother and captain, Nurgun “swiftsteel” Avvakumov, is leaving the active roster of the HOTU team!|date=2024-07-11|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* July 18th - '''HOTU''' sign [[Re1GN]] on trial. <ref name="Re1GN trial">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_5211|title=Re1GN присоединяется к нашему составу!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Re1GN joins our roster!|date=2024-07-18|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* August 6th - [[Re1GN]] completes his trial successfully and joins '''HOTU''' on a permanent basis. <ref name="+Re1GN">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_5238|title=ТЕСТОВЫЙ ПЕРИОД В.С.Ё. ДОБРО ПОЖАЛОВАТЬ!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=TEST PERIOD E.N.D. WELCOME!|date=2024-08-06|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* August 28th - '''HOTU''' release [[swiftsteel]]. <ref name="-swiftsteel">{{inside source|date=2024-08-28|source=Van Dunken$$$}}</ref>
* November 12th - '''HOTU''' sign [[mou]] as their coach. <ref name="+mou">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_6043|title=Рустем «Mou» Телепов присоединяется к HOTU на позицию главного тренера|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Rustem "Mou" Telepov joins HOTU as head coach|date=2024-11-12|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* November 13th - '''HOTU''' bench [[anttzz]] and sign [[kade0]] as his replacement. <ref name="anttzz bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_6049|title=Как уже многим известно, Дмитрий «Anttzz» Кириллин садится на скамейку запасных|trans_title=As many already know, Dmitry “Anttzz” Kirillin sits on the bench|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-11-13|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref><ref name="+kade0">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_6051|title=Встречайте, новый игрок HOTU — Айдос «Kade0» Хайржан!|trans_title=Meet the new HOTU player - Aidos “Kade0” Khairzhan!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2024-11-13|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 17th - '''HOTU''' release [[anttzz]] and [[fineshine]] is acquired by [[GUN5 Esports]]. <ref name="-anttzz">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_6254|title=Дмитрий «Anttzz» Кириллин официально становится свободным агентом!|trans_title=Dmitriy "Anttzz" Kirillin officially becomes a free agent!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-01-17|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref><ref name="-fineshine">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_6262|title=Мы рады сообщить, что Иван «Fineshine52» Лукин начинает новый этап своей карьеры в составе GUN5!|trans_title=We are pleased to announce that Ivan "Fineshine52" Lukin is starting a new stage of his career as part of GUN5!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-01-17|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* January 18th - '''HOTU''' acquire [[youka]] from [[QUAZAR Academy]]. <ref name="+youka">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_6270|title=Мы рады приветствовать нового игрока нашей команды — Анатолия «youka» Апросимова|trans_title=We are pleased to welcome a new player to our team - Anatoly "youka" Aprosimov|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-01-18|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* January 30th - '''HOTU''' sign [[dukefissura]] as an analyst. <ref name="+dukefissura">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_6307|title=Сулеймен «dukefissura» Оразалы присоединяется к HOTU на позицию аналитика!|trans_title=Sūleimen "dukefissura" Orazaly joins HOTUas an analyst!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-01-30|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* April 24th - '''HOTU''' bench [[Re1GN]]. <ref name="Re1GN bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/HOTUeSports/status/1915476450464993491|title=Даниил «Re1GN» Чеканин был переведен на скамейку запасных и выставлен на трансфер|trans_title=Daniil "Re1GN" Chekanin was moved to the bench and put on the transfer list|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-04-24|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* April 26th - '''HOTU''' move [[dukefissura]] to a player position. <ref name="dukefissura player">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/HOTUeSports/status/1916177978549039364|title=Сулеймен «Dukefissura» Оразалы — пятый игрок HOTU!|trans_title=Suleimen "Dukefissura" Orazaly is the fifth HOTU player!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-04-26|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* July 7th - '''HOTU''' bench [[youka]]. <ref name="youka bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_7227|title=Анатолий «Youka» Апросимов покидает активный ростер HOTU!|trans_title=Anatoliy "Youka" Aprosimov leaves the active HOTU roster!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-07-07|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''HOTU''' acquire [[frontales]] from [[Hesta]]. <ref name="+frontales">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_7468|title=Ким «frontales» Аргунов успешно проходит тестовый период и присоединяется к нашем составу!|trans_title=Kim "frontales" Argunov successfully passes the testing period and joins our team!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-08-11|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* August 12th - [[Re1GN]] is acquired by [[Nuclear TigeRES]]. <ref name="-Re1GN">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/nucleartigeres/306|title=Даниил Re1GN Чеканин — официально игрок Nuclear TigeRES|trans_title=Daniil Re1GN Chekanin is officially a Nuclear TigeRES player|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-08-12|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* August 31st - '''HOTU''' acquire [[n0rb3r7]] on loan from [[Virtus.pro]] for two months. <ref name="n0rb3r7 loan">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_7627|title=Друзья, у нас важная новость. На правах аренды к нам присоединяется n0rb3r7!|trans_title=Friends, we have important news. n0rb3r7 is joining us on loan!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-08-31|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* October 29th - '''HOTU''' acquire [[kAlash]] on loan from [[AMKAL ESPORTS]]. <ref name="kAlash loan">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_8097|title=Альтаир «kAlash» Аскаров присоединяется к HOTU на правах аренды!|trans_title=Altair «kAlash» Askarov joins HOTU on a loan deal!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-10-29|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* November 15th - '''HOTU''' acquire [[n0rb3r7]] from [[Virtus.pro]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="+n0rb3r7">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/hotuesports/status/1989628059109007637|title=David n0rb3r7 Danielyan, welcome to HOTU!|date=2025-11-15|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* November 21st - '''HOTU''' loan [[kade0]] to [[ALLINNERS]]. <ref name="kade0 loan">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_8140|title=Айдос «Kade0» Хайржан переходит в состав ALLINNERS на правах аренды|trans_title=Aidos «Kade0» Hairjan joins ALLINNERS on loan|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-11-21|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* December 30th - '''HOTU''' release [[youka]]. <ref name="-youka">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-210745474_8254|title=Анатолий «Youka» Апросимов покидает стан команды HOTU!|trans_title=Anatoliy "Youka" Aprosimov leaves the HOTU team!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-12-30|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* March 23rd - '''HOTU''' loan [[kade0]] to [[DEPO]]. <ref name="kade0 to DEPO">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/hotu_esports/3308|title=Айдос «Kade0» Хайржан переходит в состав DEPO на правах аренды|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Aidos "Kade0" Khairzhan joins DEPO on loan|date=2026-03-23|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* April 17th - '''HOTU''' bench [[dukefissura]]. <ref name="dukefissura bench">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/hotu_esports/3630|title=Иногда даже сильнейшие составы требуют изменений|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Sometimes even the strongest line-ups need to be changed|date=2026-04-17|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* April 19th - '''HOTU''' part ways with [[kAlash]]. <ref name="-kAlash">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/hotuesports/status/2045822306392436953|title=Altair "kAlash" Askarov, who played for our team on loan, is leaving the squad|date=2026-04-19|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* April 30th - '''HOTU''' recall [[kade0]] from his loan to [[DEPO]] and reinstate him to the active roster. <ref name="kade0 back">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/HOTUeSports/status/2049782428458213586|title=Aidos "kade0" Khairzhan returns to the main roster of HOTU!|date=2026-04-30|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* May 6th - '''HOTU''' sign [[Meand]] as an analyst. <ref name="+Meand">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/hotu_esports/3678|title=Юрий "Meand" Манджиев присоединяется к HOTU в роли аналитика|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Yuri "Meand" Mandzhiev joins HOTU as an analyst|date=2026-05-06|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* June 5th - '''HOTU''' acquire [[dwushka]] on loan from [[Insilio]]. <ref name="+dwushka">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/hotu_esports/3886|title=Welcomes a new player!|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-06-05|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* June 19th - '''HOTU''' loan [[dukefissura]] to [[GamePoint (Uzbek team)|GamePoint]]. <ref name="dukefissura loan">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/hotu_esports/3938|title=Сулеймен «dukefissura» Оразалы переходит в Game Point на правах аренды|trans_title=Suleiman «dukefissura» Orazaly is joining Game Point on loan|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-06-19|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
* August 22nd - [[dukefissura]] is acquired by [[Rune Eaters Esports]]. <ref name="dukefissura">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/hotu_esports/4348|title=Сулеймен dukefissura Оразалы переходит в Rune Eaters|trans_title=Suleymen dukefissura Orazaly is moving to Rune Eaters|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-08-22|author='''HOTU'''}}</ref>
}}

