'''IC Esports''' (formerly stylized as '''Inner Circle Esports''') is a [[:Category:United Kingdom|British]] professional esports organization which entered ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' in January 2025.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
|This=2

|content1=
*January 17th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with a lineup consisting of [[Fessor]], [[kRaSnaL]], [[STYKO]], [[Q-Q]], [[oskar]], and [[lmbt]] as coach. <ref name="IC">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1880222806853710120|title=Welcome to the Circle|date=2025-01-17|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*May 28th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' bench [[lmbt]]. <ref name="lmbt bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/incircleesports/status/1927711694576300092|title=We’ve got an update on our CS2 roster|date=2025-05-28|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 5th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' sign [[nawrot]] as coach. <ref name="+nawrot +boskacz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1930610750072008861|title=A few updates in our CS2 roster|date=2025-06-05|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 17th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' part ways with [[oskar]]. <ref name="-oskar">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/incircleesports/status/1935035482372477411|title=Today we part ways with the man, the myth, the legend – @CSGOoskar|date=2025-06-17|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 18th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' bench [[Fessor]] and part ways with [[Q-Q]]. <ref name="-dk duo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1935321650913767524|title=Roster changes continue|date=2025-06-18|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 2nd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' bench [[STYKO]]. <ref name="STYKO bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1940334679426523536|title=Another change in our active line-up: STYKO moves to the bench and is now open to new opportunities|date=2025-07-02|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 3rd - [[lmbt]] is acquired by [[MOUZ NXT]]. <ref name="-lmbt">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/mousesports/status/1940787628615352527|title=He made his mark in MOUZ history and now he’s back|date=2025-07-03|author=[[MOUZ]]}}</ref>
*July 4th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' sign [[hades]], [[Kylar]], and [[mynio]] while acquiring [[KEi]] from [[Monte]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="pl lineup">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/incircleesports/status/1941127933155811772|title=Sometimes the answer is obvious|date=2025-07-04|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 14th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' sign [[Grashog]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+Grashog">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1944743658193813980|title=More brains = more wins|date=2025-07-14|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*September 13th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' bench and transfer-list their lineup. <ref name="bench pl lineup">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1966887110587347378|title=Stay tuned for upcoming updates|date=2025-09-13|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*September 22nd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' part ways with [[nawrot]]. <ref name="-nawrot">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nawrot_cs/status/1970119946580680854|title=As of today I'm no longer under contract in @InCircleEsports|date=2025-09-22|author=[[nawrot]]}}</ref>
*September 25th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' acquire [[TEAM NEXT LEVEL]] organization, as a result, the latter's lineup is transferred over to the former. <ref name="+tnl">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1971220526853972377|title=For those who are waiting for CS2 roster announcement|date=2025-09-25|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*October 22nd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' bench [[nifee]] due to personal reasons and add [[zeRRoFIX]] as a stand-in. <ref name="nifee bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1981027800212484223|title=CS2 roster update|date=2025-10-22|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*October 23rd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' release [[kRaSnaL]] and [[STYKO]]. <ref name="-kRaSnaL -STYKO">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1981360088641392757|title=Today we part ways with two players who have been with us since the very beginning, STYKO and kRaSnaL|date=2025-10-23|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*October 31st - '''Inner Circle Esports''' part ways with [[Grashog]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-Grashog">{{inside source|source=boskacz}}</ref>
*November 6th - '''Inner Circle Esports''' release [[Kylar]], [[mynio]], and [[KEi]]. <ref name="-3 pl">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/1986486946214867118|title=Today, we part ways with Kylar, Kei, Mynio, and Grashog|date=2025-11-06|author='''Inner Circle Esports'''}}</ref>
*November 23rd - '''Inner Circle Esports''' release [[Fessor]]. <ref name="-Fessor">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FessorCS/status/1992650621695197444|title=I am back - Looking for a team!|date=2025-11-23|author=[[Fessor]]}}</ref>

|content2=
