* November 14th - '''JiJieHao''' sign [[BOROS]]. <ref name="+boros">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/jijiehaocs2/status/1989297682037314017|title=We’re pleased to announce that Boros is officially returning to our roster|date=2025-11-14|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>

|content8=
