* June 4th - '''K27''' release [[Aliot]] upon the end of his contract. <ref name="-Aliot">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/K27_esports/1020|title=Aliot покидает организацию K27 — с февраля этого года Никита сидел на скамейке запасных|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Aliot leaves the K27 organization - since February of this year Nikita has been sitting on the bench|date=2025-06-04|author='''K27'''}}</ref>
* July 9th - '''K27''' part ways with [[Meand]]. <ref name="-Meand">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/K27_esports/1120|title=Сегодня на грустном, двадцать седьмые — Юрий «Meand» Манджиев по собственному желанию решил покинуть команду|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today on a sad note, twenty-seventh - Yuriy "Meand" Mandzhiev voluntarily decided to leave the team|date=2025-07-09|author='''K27'''}}</ref>
* July 11th - '''K27''' acquire [[X5G7V]] from [[Team Space]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="+X5G7V">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/K27_esports/1123|title=Сегодня у нас новости... Опять|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today we have news... Again|date=2025-07-11|author='''K27'''}}</ref>
* July 13th - '''K27''' sign [[balblna]] as coach. <ref name="+balblna">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/K27_esports/1135|title=Просим любить и жаловать, наш новый тренер — Григорий «balblna» Олейник|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Please love and welcome our new coach - Grigoriy "balblna" Oleynik|date=2025-07-13|author='''K27'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* April 22nd - '''K27''' bench [[relaxxie]] and acquire [[fame]] on loan from [[Virtus.pro]] until the end of May. <ref name="relaxxie bench">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/K27_esports/2628|title=Сегодня мы вынуждены объявить об уходе relaxxie|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today we have to announce the departure of relaxxie|date=2026-04-22|author='''K27'''}}</ref><ref name="fame loan">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/K27_esports/2633|title=fame сыграет на PGL Astana вместе с K27|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=fame will compete at PGL Astana alongside K27|date=2026-04-22|author='''K27'''}}</ref>
*May 18th - [[Virtus.pro]] and '''K27''' agree to extend [[fame]]'s loan until the end of June. <ref name="fame loan extension">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/K27_esports/2708|title=fame остается в K27 — мы пришли к договоренности с Virtus.рrо о продлении аренды Пети на июнь!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=fame remains in K27 - we came to an agreement with Virtus.pro to extend Petya's loan until June!|date=2026-05-18|author='''K27'''}}</ref>
*July 1st - '''K27''' part ways with [[fame]] upon the expiration of his loan. <ref name="-fame loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/K27_esports/status/2072373387712778347|title=fame's loan to K27 has come to an end|date=2026-07-01|author='''K27'''}}</ref>
*July 3rd - '''K27''' acquire [[clax]] from [[Sangal Esports]]. <ref name="+clax">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/K27_esports/status/2072999343812952138|title=Welcome @claxcs2 to K27 Family|date=2026-07-03|author='''K27'''}}</ref>
}}

