'''Luminosity Gaming''' is a [[:Category:Canada|Canadian]] esports organization based in Toronto, Canada founded in February 2015 by Steve Maida. After operating independently from 2015 to 2019, on September 3rd, 2019 the organization was acquired by Enthusiast Gaming. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.enthusiastgaming.com/enthusiast-gaming-completes-merger-with-aquilini-gameco-wnd-luminosity-to-form-global-esports-and-gaming-leader/|title=Enthusiast Gaming Completes Merger With Aquilini GameCo and Luminosity to Form Global Esports and Gaming Leader - Enthusiast Gaming|date=2019-09-03|publisher=[[Enthusiast Gaming]]}}</ref> It was later reacquired by Steve Maida on January 16th, 2026, with the organziation entering ''[[Counter-Strike 2|Counter-Strike 2]]'' on July 1st, 2026. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Luminosity/status/2012344501495271566|title=HE'S BAAAACK! |date=2026-01-16|author='''Luminosity Gaming'''}}</ref>

