* February 27th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' sign [[Mythic]]. <ref name="Mythic join Luminosity Gaming">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/14346-mythic-join-luminosity-gaming|title=Mythic join Luminosity Gaming|date=2015-02-26|author=[[stich]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
